# promise: #50 #88
# The toolbar as shipped for #50 and #88, drawn from the running window: with the sidebar shown its
# header carries the toggle and the bar starts with ← → ↻ (#50); the address shows the host only,
# with Arc's Copy URL glyph as a button of its own (#88). With the sidebar hidden the toggle comes
# back first in the bar, 21 pt from the card edge like the first glyph before it (#50).
budget rss=600 stalls50=10
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "showToolbar": true}
cra://debug?windowSize=1280x800
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=toolbar
wait 3
snapshot PaneToolbarView toolbar-host-only
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 2
snapshot PaneToolbarView toolbar-sidebar-hidden
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
